B.ab6=new A.cV("false_scope","Campus","School news photo","What does the real notice actually cover?","Misleading posts often start with something real and then stretch the scope. Compare the claim with the original notice.",!0,B.RE,'The photo is real, but its caption says "one school".',"The news item is from this week.","The real notice is from one school in Brgy. {town}: two days of cleaning after dengue cases.","Parents from other schools say their classes are still on.",B.v,B.F,B.I,B.v,null,B.F)
