B.aba=new A.cV("ghost_wrong_site","Government","Empty lot photo","Is the photo really from Brgy. {town}?","Corruption is a real issue and worth asking about. But a photo of the wrong place is not proof. Accountability needs accurate evidence.",!0,B.T3,"The empty lot was photographed two weeks ago in Brgy. {town2}, a different barangay.","The photo is real but is two weeks old.","The city's inspection report shows the Brgy. {town} wall as finished, with dated photos.","Residents say the wall exists, but the old drainage still floods.",B.I,B.F,B.I,B.v,null,B.F)
