B.a95=new A.e8("class_gc_real","Class GC \u2022 Ate Mika","+63 998 \u2022\u2022\u2022 0412",!1,B.Qz,B.R2,"","Saved contact in your class group.","Pay the class treasurer in person like the group agreed",B.Q1,B.QJ,B.Rm,"Money requests from people you know can be real. This one matched a class decision and used the agreed in-person payment.","Do you know this person, and did the class agree to this?")
B.QT=s(["Hi! Natanggap na namin ang return request #R{id} mo. Ang refund ay mapupunta sa original payment method within 5-7 days. Wala nang kailangang gawin \ud83d\ude42"],t.s)
