B.Ru=s(['Send your wallet PIN so they can "speed up" the refund','Click a link to "track" the refund (none was sent)'],t.s)
B.RW=s(["The refund arrives a few days later \u2705"],t.s)
B.R1=s(["Nothing good comes from sharing a PIN for a refund. Real refunds never need it."],t.s)
B.a8Z=new A.e8("refund_real","{store} Support","+63 920 \u2022\u2022\u2022 8841",!1,B.QT,B.Qd,"","Matches the number shown in your app's help page.","Wait for the refund; do nothing else",B.Ru,B.RW,B.R1,"A real refund message asks nothing from you. Notice what it did NOT ask for.","What, if anything, is the message asking you to do?")
