B.a8U=new A.e8("portal_real","Registrar","REGISTRAR",!1,B.Qy,B.Qo,"{schoolDomain}.example","The same sender name as your earlier school reminders.","Open the portal yourself and finish the last 2 steps",B.Qx,B.RL,B.Tb,"Urgent does not mean fake. The deadline matched your own progress, the domain was the school's, and it asked for no password.","Does it match what you are already doing?")
