B.S0=s(["That code is the key to your wallet. The scammer logs in and empties it.","Chatting longer gives them time to pressure you."],t.s)
B.a96=new A.e8("otp_call","Unknown","+63 917 \u2022\u2022\u2022 3009",!0,B.SN,B.SV,"",u.P,"Hang up or stop replying. Check the alert inside the app yourself",B.R4,B.Pe,B.S0,"Real security teams never ask you to read out a code. The code is what lets them in.","Would a real company ask for your code?")
